{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game, except for some translations, does not utilize any material generated by AI. The entire process\u2014including code, script, art, special effects, music, and more\u2014involves no AI participation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This\u00a0is\u00a0a\u00a0simple\u00a0yet\u00a0exhilarating\u00a0command-based\u00a0dungeon\u00a0RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.\u00a0Explore\u00a0dungeons\u00a0filled\u00a0with\u00a0rich\u00a0and\u00a0interesting\u00a0map\u00a0elements:\u00a0open\u00a0treasure\u00a0chests,\u00a0defeat\u00a0bosses,\u00a0and\u00a0collect\u00a0special\u00a0items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110000/extras/04eabd2904a6908b1c63c355f5bb65d9.avif?t=1770430020\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110000/extras_big/04eabd2904a6908b1c63c355f5bb65d9.avif?t=1770430020 width=1560 height=838 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.\u00a0Super\u00a0exhilarating\u00a0command-based\u00a0battles.\u00a0Combat\u00a0uses\u00a0only\u00a0two\u00a0buttons\u00a0for\u00a0attack\u00a0and\u00a0defense.\u00a0Perfectly\u00a0defend\u00a0against\u00a0enemies\u00a0by\u00a0inputting\u00a0the\u00a0correct\u00a0commands,\u00a0while\u00a0accumulating\u00a0combos\u00a0through\u00a0timely\u00a0attacks\u00a0to\u00a0unleash\u00a0powerful\u00a0finishing\u00a0moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110000/extras/333d136e43526b4fea0ee7a6170eb00c.avif?t=1770430020\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110000/extras_big/333d136e43526b4fea0ee7a6170eb00c.avif?t=1770430020 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110000/extras/05d7f727aa21cf3decd99530568ad180.avif?t=1770430020\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110000/extras_big/05d7f727aa21cf3decd99530568ad180.avif?t=1770430020 width=1560 height=842 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.\u00a0Cultivate\u00a0your\u00a0character\u00a0with\u00a0a\u00a0stat\u00a0upgrade\u00a0system.\u00a0Even\u00a0when\u00a0encountering\u00a0powerful\u00a0enemies,\u00a0you\u00a0can\u00a0enhance\u00a0your\u00a0attributes\u00a0and\u00a0return\u00a0to\u00a0challenge\u00a0them\u00a0to\u00a0achieve\u00a0a\u00a0comeback\u00a0victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.\u00a0Encounter\u00a0all\u00a0kinds\u00a0of\u00a0travelers\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0dungeon.\u00a0Meet\u00a0various\u00a0people,\u00a0listen\u00a0to\u00a0their\u00a0strange\u00a0experiences,\u00a0and\u00a0unravel\u00a0the\u00a0mysteries\u00a0within\u00a0the\u00a0tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110000/extras/ea5f911f4f6f254f70ecc89545aaeeba.avif?t=1770430020\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110000/extras_big/ea5f911f4f6f254f70ecc89545aaeeba.avif?t=1770430020 width=1560 height=838 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Human","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3110000/31a331e642c035fea798daec307f397c6ef908bb.jpg"},{"name":"Hunk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3110000/c26e9a7521368944db6c5d25091382402426e6d3.jpg"},{"name":"Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3110000/90e9989f8192788053dcad10432179bc9528df8d.jpg"},{"name":"Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3110000/c951cbe8273c06e967538d6996d676134a1342